#: .\porto\templates\index.html:172
msgid ""
"Siswa kelas 12 SMK jurusan DPIB yang merangkap sebagai Software Developer. "
"Founder dari Civilix.app, membangun ekosistem berbasis AI untuk otomatisasi "
"kerja Arsitektur & Teknik Sipil."
msgstr ""
"12th-grade vocational school student majoring in DPIB who doubles as a "
"Software Developer. Founder of Civilix.app, building an AI-based ecosystem "
"for Architecture & Civil Engineering workflow automation."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:177
