#: .\porto\templates\index.html:226
msgid "Halo, saya Dimas Satria Pasha."
msgstr "Hello, I am Dimas Satria Pasha."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:227
msgid "Drafter Arsitektur & Pengembang Perangkat Lunak."
msgstr "Architectural Drafter & Software Developer."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:232
msgid ""
"Berawal dari eksperimen mempelajari dunia pemrograman dan kecerdasan buatan "
"(AI), kini sebagai <span class=\"text-white font-medium\">siswa SMK jurusan "
"DPIB (Desain Pemodelan dan Informasi Bangunan)</span>, saya berhasil "
"menyatukan dua dunia yang berbeda. Saya memadukan keahlian merancang "
"bangunan dengan <span class=\"text-white font-medium\">logika algoritma "
"perangkat lunak</span>."
msgstr ""
"Starting from an experiment in learning programming and artificial "
"intelligence (AI), now as a <span class=\"text-white font-"
"medium\">vocational school student majoring in DPIB (Building Modeling and "
"Information Design)</span>, I have successfully united two different worlds. "
"I combine building design expertise with <span class=\"text-white font-"
"medium\">software algorithmic logic</span>."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:235
msgid ""
"Kolaborasi ilmu inilah yang mendorong saya membangun ekosistem perangkat "
"lunak (seperti Civilix) untuk memecahkan masalah kompleks dan <span "
"class=\"text-white font-medium\">mempermudah pekerjaan harian</span> para "
"arsitek, surveyor, dan insinyur konstruksi di lapangan."
msgstr ""
"This collaboration of knowledge drives me to build a software ecosystem "
"(like Civilix) to solve complex problems and <span class=\"text-white font-"
"medium\">simplify the daily work</span> of architects, surveyors, and "
"construction engineers in the field."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:248
msgid ""
"\"Teknologi terbaik dalam arsitektur bukanlah yang terlihat keren di layar, "
"melainkan yang <span class=\"font-bold text-brand-accent "
"italic\">menyelesaikan masalah nyata</span> di lapangan.\""
msgstr ""
"\"The best technology in architecture is not what looks cool on screen, but "
"what <span class=\"font-bold text-brand-accent italic\">solves real "
"problems</span> in the field.\""

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:264
