#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Sistem kalkulasi waterpass dan cut/fill otomatis terintegrasi cloud untuk "
#| "meminimalisir kesalahan lapangan."
msgid ""
"Sistem kalkulasi otomatis untuk potongan memanjang, melintang, dan cut/fill "
"(beserta hasil gambar CAD). Terintegrasi dengan cloud dan AI analyzer untuk "
"meminimalisir kesalahan di lapangan."
msgstr ""
"Automated calculation system for longitudinal/cross sections and cut/fill "
"(including CAD outputs). Cloud-integrated with an AI analyzer to minimize "
"on-site errors."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:322
msgid ""
"Asisten virtual cerdas berbasis LLM Google Gemini untuk pencarian objek 3D "
"dan material. Dilengkapi fitur tanya jawab seputar arsitektur dan konstruksi "
"dengan dukungan database peraturan pemerintah."
msgstr ""
"Intelligent virtual assistant powered by Google Gemini LLM for finding 3D "
"objects and materials. Features architecture & construction Q&A backed by "
"government regulation databases."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:347
msgid ""
"Menyediakan fitur konversi gambar kerja CAD ke PDF, penerjemah teks dalam "
"gambar kerja antar bahasa, serta asisten AI untuk mempermudah penyusunan "
"denah."
msgstr ""
"Provides CAD to PDF conversion, cross-language translation for working "
"drawings, and an AI assistant to streamline floor plan creation."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:368
msgid "Drafting & Rencana Kerja"
msgstr "Drafting & Working Drawings"

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:369
msgid ""
"Gambar kerja arsitektur dan struktur detail siap untuk pelaksanaan "
"konstruksi."
msgstr ""
"Detailed architectural and structural working drawings ready for "
"construction."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:387
msgid ""
"Pemodelan Building Information Modeling (BIM) menggunakan Autodesk Revit."
msgstr "Building Information Modeling (BIM) using Autodesk Revit."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:415
msgid "Visualisasi 3D dan rendering sinematik untuk desain hunian mewah."
msgstr ""
"3D visualization and cinematic rendering for luxury residential designs."

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:438
msgid "Clipix Video Engine"
msgstr "Clipix Video Engine"

#: .\porto\templates\index.html:439
msgid ""
"Sistem pintar memotong klip video secara otomatis dengan integrasi AI kurasi "
"momen."
