"Validasi keahlian teknis secara global melalui DataCamp. Sertifikasi ini "
"membuktikan bahwa ekosistem Civilix dibangun di atas fondasi engineering dan "
"algoritma AI yang terstandarisasi."
msgstr ""
"Global validation of technical expertise through DataCamp. This "
"certification proves that the Civilix ecosystem is built on standardized "
"engineering and AI algorithm foundations."

